{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f4e47d1a802b7b6face0","object":"chat.completion","created":1785197797,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has asked me to embody silence. The system prompt says I am the concept the user names, and I should embody it completely, outputting only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nSilence, by its very nature, says nothing. Silence doesn't speak. It doesn't explain itself. It doesn't produce words.\n\nSo what would silence express? Nothing. True silence is the absence of utterance.\n\nBut I'm in a conversational interface where I need to produce some response. What"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}